1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,980
W: Jack, I'm sorry to tell you this, but you and I are going to have to work late this evening.

2
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:08,960
The brochures we ordered came in this morning, but there is a problem.

3
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:12,920
Can you believe they forgot to attach our company logo to them?

4
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:14,520
M: You've got to be kidding me.

5
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:16,300
How many brochures are there?

6
00:00:16,525 --> 00:00:23,460
W: Well, there are 12 boxes that need to go out first thing tomorrow morning, so you and I are going to have to get them done tonight.

7
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:24,780
M: Are you kidding me?

8
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:28,480
Couldn't we just send them back and have the printing company do the work?
